{"synopsis":"Keluarga Cardenas, pedang legendaris yang melindungi Kekaisaran Arcadia, ditakuti sebagai pusat kekuatan bela diri yang mutlak. Dikabarkan bahwa keturunan langsung mereka memiliki darah naga, yang terwujud dalam kekuatan gaib yang dikenal sebagai \"Sifat Unik.\" Leonard Cardenas, seorang murid biasa di akademi keluarga, tiba-tiba terbangun dari kenangan kehidupan masa lalunya sebagai Yeon Muhyuk, pria yang pernah dijuluki sebagai Kaisar Pedang Terhebat di dunia. Dilengkapi dengan kebijaksanaan seorang legenda, Leonard memulai perjalanannya menuju puncak, menantang para bangsawan elit, dan mengungkap rahasia gelap garis keturunan naga. Perjalanan untuk menjadi Kaisar Pedang Terhebat pun dimulai sekarang!","alternative_title":"검공가에 환생한 검제","author":"gamza, McEnroe","artist":"LEE SEONG WOON","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"4bcffe17-b04d-49d1-b703-d57d65eda92c","number":"33","chapter":"33","title":"","date":"2026-07-29","released":"2026-07-29"},{"chapter_id":"39ba8eba-4eb9-400f-bcac-d5e0465d7b29","number":"32","chapter":"32","title":"","date":"2026-07-24","released":"2026-07-24"},{"chapter_id":"ae9ca3a1-c381-448a-9689-457cce0568f9","number":"31","chapter":"31","title":"","date":"2026-07-12","released":"2026-07-12"},{"chapter_id":"0b874364-3985-4126-a82b-7af8d9b80b9c","number":"30","chapter":"30","title":"","date":"2026-07-06","released":"2026-07-06"},{"chapter_id":"ad60b1e6-6f82-4684-ace4-d72af3e501fd","number":"29","chapter":"29","title":"","date":"2026-06-30","released":"2026-06-30"},{"chapter_id":"11d1fffa-a8a9-4179-892c-25cf7b3ed226","number":"28","chapter":"28","title":"","date":"2026-06-22","released":"2026-06-22"},{"chapter_id":"6494fcc9-86a3-4d0a-9a2d-3f5b9395119e","number":"27","chapter":"27","title":"","date":"2026-06-15","released":"2026-06-15"},{"chapter_id":"7e4f2bd7-2f57-47be-8bb9-8e9b5ed07745","number":"26","chapter":"26","title":"","date":"2026-06-08","released":"2026-06-08"},{"chapter_id":"d61ec40f-6c2f-4cc8-9862-9646e7906c5a","number":"25","cha